 of West Bengal. The tender aimed at setting up of 500 MW/ 2000 MWh of standalone BESS capacity through a TariƯ-Based Competitive Bidding (TBCB) process. Under the terms of the Request for Selection (RfS), NGEL has secured 200 MW/800 MWh of BESS capacity at a discovered tariƯ of ₹4.35 lakh per MW per month in the aforesaid tender. The e-reverse auction was concluded on August 7, 2026.",
