any’s Registrar and Share Transfer Agent. Hence, pursuant to Regulation 36(1)(b), please find below web-link to access the Annual Report of Company for the Financial Year 2025-26. Web-link of Annual Report 2025-26: https://www.zentechnologies.com/annual-reports QR Code to view the Annual Reports: Thanking You, Yours Faithfully, For Zen Technologies Limited Sd/- Sourav Dhar Company Secretary & Compliance Officer",
