      "text": "10th August, 2026 To, Manager Dept. of Corporate Services Bombay Stock Exchange Limited Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Tower, Dalal Street, Mumbai – 400 001 Fax : 02222723121/2037/2039/2041 Scrip Code : 532906 corp.relations@bseindia.com To, Manager Dept. of Corporate Services The National Stock Exchange of India Limited Exchange Plaza,Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra, Mumbai – 400 051 Fax: 022-26598237/38, 26598347/48 Scrip Code : MAANALU cmlist@nse.co.in Dear Sir / Madam, Subject: Intimation of Earnings Conference Call for investors and analysts for Q1 FY27. Ref.: Regulation 30 of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015. This is in continuation to our intimation dated 08th August, 2026 informing the date of meeting of board of directors of the company for announcement of Financial Results for the quarter ended 30th June 2026 (Q1FY27). We further inform you, pursuant to Regulation 30(6) read with Schedule Il Part A Para A Clause 15 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (Listing Regulations), that post the announcement of financial results, as above, the company will host an Earnings Conference Call on Friday, 14th August, 2026 at 01:00 PM IST. The details for Conference Call are appended herewith and will be uploaded on the website of the company at www.maanaluminium.com , as well. The audio/ video recording and transcript of the call will be made available in due course. Kindly take the aforesaid information on record and oblige Thanking you Yours faithfully For Maan Aluminium Limited Sandeep (Company Secretary) Earnings Conference Call Invite Friday, August 14, 2026 MAAN Aluminium Ltd will host a conference call for investors and analysts to discuss its Operational and Financial performance Q1FY27 1:00pm +91 22 6280 1123 +91 22 7115 8024 USA 18667462133 UK 08081011573 Singapore : 8001012045 Hong Kong : 800964448 Click here to register • Mr. Ashish Jain – Ex