ecomes entitled to release of the amount of approximately Rs. 5.52 crore deposited with the Hon'ble Court, together with accrued interest, which shall accrue as an asset/cash inflow to the Company upon actual release by the Court Registry. There is no material adverse impact on the financial, operational or other activities of the Company on account of this order.",
