      "text": "YUKEN INDIA LIMITED An ISO 9001:2015 Company Manufacturers of Oil Hydraulic Equipment IN COLLABORATION WITH YUKEN KOGYO CO. LTD., JAPAN. CIN: L29150KA1976PLC003017 Regd. Office: No. 16-C, Doddanekundi Industrial Area, II Phase, Mahadevapura, Bengaluru – 560 048. Factory : PB No. 5, Koppathimmanahalli Village, Malur-Hosur Main Road, Malur Taluk, Kolar District – 563 130. Phone +91 9731610341 E-mail: Suhas.hm@yukenindia.com Date August 11, 2026 Web: www.yukenindia.com Corporate Relationship Department BSE Limited PJ Towers, Dalal Street Mumbai-400 001 Scrip Code: 522108 The Listing Department National Stock Exchange of India Ltd. Exchange Plaza, C-1, Block G, Bandra Kurla Complex, Bandra (E), Mumbai - 400 051 Symbol: YUKEN Subject: Submission of Statement of Deviation/Variation in utilisation of issue proceeds for the quarter ended June 30, 2026 Dear Sir/Madam, Pursuant to the applicable provisions of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 and other applicable provisions, we hereby submit the Statement of Deviation/Variation in utilisation of issue proceeds for the quarter ended June 30, 2026, in respect of the funds raised by the Company through Preferential Allotment. The Company had raised an amount of ₹5,991.84 lakhs through preferential allotment made on July 24, 2025, to Yuken Kogyo Co. Ltd., Japan, Promoters of the Company. We confirm that there has been no deviation or variation in the utilisation of the issue proceeds from the objects stated in the relevant fund-raising documents. The proceeds are being utilised towards the stated object of expanding the business activities and commencing the manufacturing of new products which shall be exported to Yuken Group companies and other customers . The aforesaid Statement of Deviation/Variation, duly reviewed by the Audit Committee of the Company, is enclosed herewith for your information and records. Kindly take the above on record. Thanking You For Yuken India L