. However the matter is sub-ju id ice and is subject to final disposal by the Honorable Bombay High Court. The auditors continue to modify their report on the said matter. 3 !Figures for the corresponding quarter of the previous year have been regrouped/ rearranged to conform to current quarter's presentation. Date jPlace _: 12 August, 2026 1 : Mumbai I· , Rahul Pu Managing Di DIN:01925 MUKTA ARTS LIMITED CIN:L9211OMH1982PLC028180 Regd. Office: Mukta House, Behind Whistling Woods Institute , Film City Complex, Goregaon (E), Mumbai-400 065 Additional disclosures as per Clause 52 (4) of Securities and Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015: Standalone 3 months ended Year ended S.Nc: Particulars 30th June, 31st March, 30th June, 31st March, 2026 2026 2025 2026 (Unaudited) (Audited) (unaudited) (Audited) 1 Debt Equity Ratio 0.3 0.3 0.3 0.3 /Total Debt/Total Eauilv\\ 2 Debt Service Coveraae Ratio 0.6 1.7 -0.1 4.8 EBITDA / (Interest expenses + Principal repayments of long term borrowings due within 12 months from the balance sheet date) 3 Current Ratio 20.1 17.8 17.1 17.8 Total Current Assets I Total Current Liabilities\\ 4 Trade receivables turnover ratio 0.1 0.2 0.2 0.4 (Sale of services/ Closina trade receivables\\ 5 Trade payables turnover 3.5 7.9 4.1 20.2 I/Total exoenses less deoreciation I Closina Trade oavablesl 6 Net Profit/ (Loss) Margin (%) 59.4% 29.2% 29.0% 72.0% (Profit I (Loss) After Tax / Revenue from ooerationsl 7 Return on Equity Ratio r/ol 0.7% 1.1% 0.4% 2.8% (Profit I (Loss) After Tax/ Total eauitv\\ 8 Return on Caoital Employed Ratio r1o1 2.0% 1.9% 1.7% 5.0% 'Ea rninas before Interest & Taxes IEBITl/Total Caoital Emoloved\\ 9 lnventorv Turnover Ratio 1\"%1 Nil Nil Nil Nil 10 Basic and diluted earnina oer share IEPS\\ (not annualised) 0.65 1.01 0.34 2.48 MUKTA ARTS LIMITED CIN:L9211 0MH1982PLC028180 Regd. Office: Mukta House, Behind Whistling Woods Institute, Film City Complex, Goregaon (E), Mumbai-40