h as Annexure B. CIN NO: L63040DL2005PLC463461 The above information will also be available on the website of the Company at www.yatra.com. This is for your information and records. Thanking You, Yours sincerely, For Yatra Online Limited Jyoti Chawla Company Secretary and Compliance Officer M. No. A20392 Encl.: As above",
