    "334586c83272a118c7ed91cf88caab3e4fd935a8": {
      "url": "https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ABAN_13082026164738_Uplod.pdf",
      "text": "13.08.2026 To, BSE Ltd Phiroze Jeejeebhoy Towers 21st Floor, Dalal Street Mumbai 400 001. Scrip Code :: 523204 Through :: BSE Listing Centre National Stock Exchange of India Ltd Exchange Plaza, 5th Floor Plot No :: C/1 G Block Bandra – Kurla Complex Bandra (E),Mumbai 400 051 Scrip Code :: ABAN Through :: NEAPS R espected Sir / Madam, Sub: Reasons for delay in submission of Financial Results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026 Dear Sir/Madam, With reference to your email dated 12 th August,2026 asking for reason for delay in submission of Financial Results for the quarter ended 30th June, 2026, we hereby submit our reply: The Company is undergoing the 'Corporate Insolvency Resolution Process (CIRP) under the provisions of the 'Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code, 2016' . Due to the commencement of the CIRP and changes in management and ﬁnancial reporting processes, additional time was required for collation, veriﬁcation, and reconciliation of the Company's ﬁnancial and accounting records, including transactions and balances prior to the CIRP . As a result, the ﬁnalization of the ﬁnancial statements for the year ended March 31, 2026, also required additional time. The said Financial Results have now been ﬁnalized and are expected to be submitted to the Stock Exchange(s) within the next two-three working days, upon completion of the necessary formalities. The delay in ﬁnalization of the March 2026 ﬁnancial results, and the consequential completion of the related closing balances and reconciliations, has also impacted the preparation and ﬁnalization of the Financial Results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026. Further, the Auditors are required to complete the necessary review procedures and obtain the required information, explanations, and supporting documents before ﬁnalization of the June 2026 Financial Results. The Company is making all necessary efforts to complete the pending process and submit the ﬁnancial results for the quarter ending June 30, 2026, at the earliest. This is for your information and record. Yours Faithfully, For Aban Offshore Limited (Undergoing CIRP) S hailesh Desai Resolution Professional IBBI Registration No. IBBI/IPA-001/IP-P00183/2017-18/10362",
