 Company at the ensuing 9 th Annual General Meeting. Appointment as a Chief Financial Officer (CFO) and Key Managerial Personnel (KMP) of the company w.e.f. 14th August, 2026. 2 Date of appointment/ re-appointment /cessation (as applicable) Re-appointment as Chairman cum Managing Director w.e.f. 13th August, 2026 Re-appointment as Chief Executive Officer cum Whole Time Director w.e.f. 13th August, 2026 Re-appointment as a NonExecutive Independent Director w.e.f. 24th August, 2027 Appointment w.e.f. 14th August, 2026 3 Term of Appointment/ReAppointment 3 Years, (i.e. 13th August, 2026 to 12th August, 2029) subject to the approval of members in the ensuing Annual General Meeting. 3 Years, (i.e. 13th August, 2026 to 12th August, 2029) subject to the approval of members in the ensuing Annual General Meeting. 5 years, (i.e. 24th August, 2027 to 23rd August, 2032) subject to approval of members in the ensuing Annual General Meeting. Not Applicable 4 Brief Profile (in case of Appointment) Mr. Sanjay Kumar Begani has work experience of 33 years and is responsible in handling day to day working and dealing in seeds, fertilizers, grains etc. including its marketing. Mr. Anil Kumar Nahata has completed BA and PHD in Agriculture and has work experience of 27 years and is responsible in handling day to day working and dealing in seeds, fertilizers, grains Mr. Yash Wardhan Jain is Qualified Chartered Accountant (CA) and has work experience of 13 Years in the field of Audit, Direct and Indirect Taxation Mr. Krishan Bagri is MBA graduated and also pursued CA Inter. He has work experience of 12 of years in Accounting, Taxation and Statutory Compliance. He also has Excellent etc. including its marketing. Practical Knowledge of Audit, Income Tax and GST Compliance. 5 Disclosure of Relationships between Directors (in case of Appointment) Mrs. Kiran Devi Begani (NonExecutive Director) is wife of Mr. Sanjay Kumar Begani. Mrs. Padma Nahata (NonExecutive Director) is wife of Mr. Anil Kumar